:: Mine Birth
<<effects>><<set $first_birth to !$pregnancyStats.humanToysUnlocked>>
<<if $mine.birth isnot 1>>
	<<generate2>>
	<<set $mine.birth to 1>>
	<<saveNPC 1 "mine_doctor">><<person2>>
	You regain consciousness with two voices filling the darkness. "I'm not a doctor. I've never done anything beyond helping small injuries and giving pain meds," a <<male>> voice says. "Don't care. You're the best we got," replies a <<person1>><<male>> voice.
<<else>>
	<<loadNPC 1 "mine_doctor">><<person1>>
	You regain consciousness with two voices filling the darkness. "Tend to your patient, doctor", says a <<male>> voice. "I keep telling you, I'm not a doctor," a <<person2>><<male>> voice replies. You hear a scoff.
<</if>>
<br><br>
You open your eyes to see two guards standing over you. The <<person2>><<person>> jabs a needle in your arm. "I need you to relax. It'll be over soon. Just drift away. When you awaken, everything will be fine," <<he>> says softly as your consciousness drifts away again.

<br><br>
<<wash>><<undress "mine_birth">>
<<link [[Next|Mine Birth 2]]>><</link>>




:: Mine Birth 2
<<effects>>

<<set _timeCalc to birthLaborTime()>>

<<switch playerNormalPregnancyType()>>
	<<case "human">>
		<<set $phase to 0>>
		A voice echoes in your head. "The head is coming out. That's good."
	<<case "wolf">>
		<<set $phase to 1>>
		A voice echoes in your head, "I don't think that's normal, but its head is coming out just fine."
<</switch>>

<br><br>
You hear the voice tell you to push over and over again. You don't know if you can, but you try anyway.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next (<<print getTimeString(_timeCalc)>>)|Mine Birth 3]]>><<run setPlayerLitterBorn()>><<pass _timeCalc>><</link>>



:: Mine Birth 3
<<effects>><<set $litter_size to getLabouringLitter("pc").length>><<person1>>

You awaken in a dark cave.

<<if $litter_size is 1>>
	The <<person>> notices you awaken. "Don't be alarmed. Your child is safe.
	<<if $phase is 0>>
		It has been sent to the orphanage."
	<<elseif $phase is 1>>
		It'll be sent to the forest when it can fend for itself."
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	The <<person>> notices you awaken. "Don't be alarmed, your children are safe.
	<<if $phase is 0>>
		They've been sent to the orphanage."
	<<elseif $phase is 1>>
		They'll be sent to the forest when they can fend for themselves."
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<set $bornChildrenIds to []>>
<<run getLabouringLitter("pc").forEach(child => $bornChildrenIds.push(child.childId))>>

<<setBabyIntro "pc" "Bailey">>
<<birthUi "pc" "mine" "home" "Mine Birth 4" 120>>



:: Mine Birth 4
<<effects>>

The <<person>> helps you stand. You put your clothing back on. <<storeon "mine_birth">>

<<if $first_birth or playerNormalPregnancyTotal() is 0>>
	You feel your insides drop as you stand, but <<he>> assures you that's normal.
	<br><br>

Despite the pain, you feel a lot more comfortable walking than you did before the birth. You'd forgotten how easy it is to move without 
	<<if $phase is 0>>
		people
	<<elseif $phase is 1>>
		a litter
	<</if>>
	inside you.
	<br><br>

	The midwife helps you to dress.
<<elseif between(playerNormalPregnancyTotal(), 1, 2)>>
	You feel your insides drop as you stand. You remember this feeling from your last birth and know it's normal.
	<br><br>

	Despite the pain, you feel a lot more comfortable walking than you did before the birth. You'd forgotten how easy it is to move without 
	<<if $phase is 0>>
		people
	<<elseif $phase is 1>>
		a litter
	<</if>>
	inside you.
	<br><br>

	The midwife helps you to dress.
<<elseif between(playerNormalPregnancyTotal(), 3, 7)>>
	You feel your insides drop as you stand. You're still not used to the feeling.
	<br><br>

	You get walking again quite easily. It's a little awkward, but the transition isn't as bad as it used to be. It's still easier to move around when there isn't
	<<if $phase is 0>>
		people
	<<elseif $phase is 1>>
		a litter
	<</if>>
	inside you.
	<br><br>

	The midwife still insists on helping you dress.
<<elseif between(playerNormalPregnancyTotal(), 8, 19)>>
	You stand up without a hitch. There's hardly any difference in feeling anymore, although you do feel much more nimble.
	<br><br>

	<<He>> looks impressed at your mobility, only keeping an arm around you for stability. "I don't see many people get back up that quickly. You must be hardy!"
	<br><br>

	The midwife still insists on helping you dress.
<<elseif playerNormalPregnancyTotal() gte 20>>
	You stand up without assistance, feeling empty inside. You already miss the feeling of being pregnant.
	<br><br>

	<<He>> stares at you, mouth agape, as you walk without any assistance. You throw your clothes back on quickly.
	<br><br>

	"Y-you should be good to go," <<he>> says.
<</if>>
<br><br>
A <<person2>><<person>> walks into the cave. "Follow me," <<he>> says. You reluctantly walk with <<him>><<if playerNormalPregnancyTotal() lte 7>>, the <<person1>><<person>> helps you walk until you can manage yourself<<person2>><</if>>.

<<if Time.hour lte 5 or Time.hour gte 21>>
	The <<person>> brings you to a cave full of people. The guard at the gate opens it and closes it behind you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<exit>>
<</if>>

<<switch $mine.job.current>>
	<<case "mining">>
		The <<person>> brings you to a group of slaves. <<He>> chains you to the rest of them and walks off.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Mine Job Mining]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<case "minecarts">>
		The <<person>> brings you to a minecart track and attaches a chain hanging off a rail on the ceiling to your shackles and walks off.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<case "cleaning">>
		The <<person>> brings you to the guard room. "Get to work," <<he>> says as <<he>> sits in a chair.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<default>>
		Please Report this Error in the #bug-reports channel of the Degrees of Lewdity Discord Server 
<</switch>>
